    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<ul><li data-start="63" data-end="210"><p data-start="65" data-end="210"><strong data-start="65" data-end="98">Decentralized event creation:</strong> Initially, ticket sales were managed on Eventbrite, and event management relied on both Eventbrite and Excel.</p></li><li data-start="212" data-end="401"><p data-start="214" data-end="401"><strong data-start="214" data-end="244">Automatic contact updates:</strong> Clients can update their profiles on BreakTheIce’s external platform (Umbraco), and the contact data is automatically synchronized with the Odoo database.</p></li></ul><img class="aligncenter wp-image-1399 size-large" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-1024x683.webp" alt="Breaktheice event" width="1024" height="683" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-2048x1365.webp 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BTI-1400x933.webp 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px">'
    solutionLabel: THE SOLUTION
    solution: <p>BreakTheIce’s Odoo database has been customized to perfectly fit their business workflows.<br data-start="133" data-end="136">It includes event management, a powerful CRM to manage supply and demand,<br data-start="209" data-end="212">as well as an integration with the Umbraco CMS.<br data-start="259" data-end="262">This setup streamlines information exchange between Umbraco and Odoo,<br data-start="331" data-end="334">ensuring efficient synchronization and centralized data management.</p>
